<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Peptech to raise A$20 mln with issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Peptech to raise A$20 mln with issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drug developer Peptech Ltd, formerly Peptide Technology, said on Thursday it would raise at least A$20 million from a private share placement to help with its listing later this month on the London stock exchange.</p>
<p>Peptech said the share issue to United Kingdom and European investors would be coordinated by Nomura Securities, which is also sponsing the company's listing.</p>
<p>Executive director, operations, Darryl Mellish, told Reuters the pricing of the issue had not been determined but the company had shareholder approval to issue up to 50 million new shares.</p>
</text>
